      "notes": [
        {
          "text": "Notified in the Tamil Nadu Government Gazette of 10 June 2026 and in force 'after expiry of 30 days from the date of notification' (clause 2.9 of the Tariff Policy 2021). The port has not published a start date; Paradip Port reads the same clause as day 30 (10 September to 10 October 2026), so this is entered from 10 July 2026. Subject to annual indexation from 1 May."
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilotage rates are per GRT by size band, with no statement that they apply incrementally, so the whole tonnage is charged at its band's rate.",
          "source": {
            "document": "tn-gazette-2026-sor",
            "page": 11,
            "section": "2.2.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "The schedule does not say whether pilotage includes berthing tugs. Tugs can be hired at Rs. 39,354 / US$ 1,491 per tug per hour (minimum 2 hours); towage is not added to estimates.",
          "source": {
            "document": "tn-gazette-2026-sor",
            "page": 12,
            "section": "2.2.4"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'Bulk / Break Bulk vessels' rates are used for general cargo ships.",
          "source": {
            "document": "tn-gazette-2026-sor",
            "page": 10,
            "section": "2.1.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "The pilotage minimum row prints Rs. 32,289 split across two cells; the PDF confirms Rs. 32,289 for coastal and US$ 1,222 for foreign ships.",
          "source": {
            "document": "tn-gazette-2026-sor",
            "page": 11
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Cruise ships pay a fixed cruise tariff instead (US$ 0.0850 per GRT for the first 12 hours, then US$ 0.0175 per GRT per hour, plus US$ 6 per passenger; section 2.3.5), with no port dues, pilotage or berth hire. Cruise calls are not priced; 'passenger' ships here means other passenger vessels.",
          "source": {
            "document": "tn-gazette-2026-sor",
            "page": 16,
            "section": "2.3.5"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
